menu "Edrumulus Synthetic Test"

    config EDRUMULUS_SYNTHTEST_AUTOSTART
        bool "Enable synthetic test mode automatically at boot"
        default n
        help
            Starts the synthetic piezo signal generator at boot (issue #19).
            While enabled, the ADC continuous conversion is stopped and the
            detection pipeline is fed with synthetic damped sine bursts.
            Useful to validate the full DSP->MIDI pipeline without hardware.
            Console commands (test hit / test auto / test stop) are the
            preferred runtime control once available.

endmenu
